        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/d76d1ea621d3d9219551ce401825a085.avif?t=1757361623\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >License to Grill is a multiplayer 3rd Person Combat game with up to <strong>8 players</strong>. Your goal is to <strong>cook your friends</strong> in Free For All matches. Take advantage of wacky <strong>ragdoll physics</strong> to knock your friends into an an oven or tenderize them with a big hammer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/882ebb3d69cbcf8edb07211edab1b092.poster.avif?t=1757361623\" width=1198 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/882ebb3d69cbcf8edb07211edab1b092.webm?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/882ebb3d69cbcf8edb07211edab1b092.mp4?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/ca47ff6b436faec978923ec17c743130.avif?t=1757361623\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of <strong>wacky and powerful weapons</strong> to cook your friends in creative ways. Each weapon has something special about it. Each weapon will heat up your opponents, eventually cooking them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Frying Pan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trusty default weapon that always comes back to you even after being thrown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meat Hammer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastating Meat Tenderizer that can slam the ground with incredible power that can knock players around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pepper Shotgun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful shotgun with strong knockback that can easily cook other players with a regular shot or a charged shot that uses more ammo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fridge Door</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A riot shield style weapon that you can use to cool yourself faster and defend from frontal attacks as well as thrust forward with incredible speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Propane Launcher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grenade launcher style weapon that fires 2 highly explosive propane tanks at once that leave fire at the point of impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/db1b01d7a6285a2e49a37deab12773ea.poster.avif?t=1757361623\" width=1198 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/db1b01d7a6285a2e49a37deab12773ea.webm?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/db1b01d7a6285a2e49a37deab12773ea.mp4?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/94894a10c24555a6f2de35e4a75dfc7b.avif?t=1757361623\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate <strong>interesting level layouts</strong> that provide plenty of opportunities for riveting interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza Party</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tight pizza kitchen inspired environment with a conveyor belt covered in weapons leading to a giant pizza oven that will cook you if fall in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market Showdown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A food market street inspired environment with a hot charcoal grill spilled in the middle of the map. Market Showdown has lots of vertical space and cover to take advantage of. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/eb0cadeef66edb5c1c78fe31d1470497.poster.avif?t=1757361623\" width=1600 height=868 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/eb0cadeef66edb5c1c78fe31d1470497.webm?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/eb0cadeef66edb5c1c78fe31d1470497.mp4?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/622093d3d57eb46e24fb18a12483a01f.avif?t=1757361623\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook the most players</strong> in a match to score the most and <strong>win</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/362026945e7adc143ac8246b3125e9f8.poster.avif?t=1757361623\" width=1192 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/362026945e7adc143ac8246b3125e9f8.webm?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/362026945e7adc143ac8246b3125e9f8.mp4?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/d76d1ea621d3d9219551ce401825a085.avif?t=1757361623\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >License to Grill is a multiplayer 3rd Person Combat game with up to <strong>8 players</strong>. Your goal is to <strong>cook your friends</strong> in Free For All matches. Take advantage of wacky <strong>ragdoll physics</strong> to knock your friends into an an oven or tenderize them with a big hammer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/882ebb3d69cbcf8edb07211edab1b092.poster.avif?t=1757361623\" width=1198 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/882ebb3d69cbcf8edb07211edab1b092.webm?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/882ebb3d69cbcf8edb07211edab1b092.mp4?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/ca47ff6b436faec978923ec17c743130.avif?t=1757361623\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of <strong>wacky and powerful weapons</strong> to cook your friends in creative ways. Each weapon has something special about it. Each weapon will heat up your opponents, eventually cooking them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Frying Pan</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trusty default weapon that always comes back to you even after being thrown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meat Hammer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastating Meat Tenderizer that can slam the ground with incredible power that can knock players around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pepper Shotgun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful shotgun with strong knockback that can easily cook other players with a regular shot or a charged shot that uses more ammo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fridge Door</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A riot shield style weapon that you can use to cool yourself faster and defend from frontal attacks as well as thrust forward with incredible speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Propane Launcher</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grenade launcher style weapon that fires 2 highly explosive propane tanks at once that leave fire at the point of impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/db1b01d7a6285a2e49a37deab12773ea.poster.avif?t=1757361623\" width=1198 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/db1b01d7a6285a2e49a37deab12773ea.webm?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/db1b01d7a6285a2e49a37deab12773ea.mp4?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/94894a10c24555a6f2de35e4a75dfc7b.avif?t=1757361623\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate <strong>interesting level layouts</strong> that provide plenty of opportunities for riveting interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pizza Party</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tight pizza kitchen inspired environment with a conveyor belt covered in weapons leading to a giant pizza oven that will cook you if fall in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market Showdown</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A food market street inspired environment with a hot charcoal grill spilled in the middle of the map. Market Showdown has lots of vertical space and cover to take advantage of. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/eb0cadeef66edb5c1c78fe31d1470497.poster.avif?t=1757361623\" width=1600 height=868 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/eb0cadeef66edb5c1c78fe31d1470497.webm?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/eb0cadeef66edb5c1c78fe31d1470497.mp4?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/622093d3d57eb46e24fb18a12483a01f.avif?t=1757361623\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook the most players</strong> in a match to score the most and <strong>win</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/362026945e7adc143ac8246b3125e9f8.poster.avif?t=1757361623\" width=1192 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/362026945e7adc143ac8246b3125e9f8.webm?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884700/extras/362026945e7adc143ac8246b3125e9f8.mp4?t=1757361623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
